      "maxInputBytes": 65536,
      "maxResponseBytes": 16777216,
      "title": "Partner Map",
      "description": "Map exchange names and slugs to CoinMarketCap ids with GET /v1/exchange/map. Composio calls this Partner Map. Its example slugs binance and gdax are exchange slugs, and the public API has no separate partners map route. listing_status, slug, start, and limit match the tool. sort, aux, and crypto_id are the other documented fields on this same GET.",
